{"id":"631789","name":"甘蓝拌鸡胸肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631789/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"绿甘蓝","amount":"120g"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"泡花生仁","amount":"几个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"甘蓝撕成块，不是包菜哦，这个口感清甜，没有土腥味。","img":"images/631789/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜切薄片。","img":"images/631789/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"焯水，开锅煮几分钟捞出。","img":"images/631789/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取鸡胸肉。","img":"images/631789/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放锅里煮一下，泡好的花生米煮一下。","img":"images/631789/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"开锅捞出鸡胸肉。","img":"images/631789/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把鸡胸肉撕成块，拌匀。","img":"images/631789/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"花生米煮10分钟，捞出放菜里。","img":"images/631789/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大蒜切末，红椒切圈。","img":"images/631789/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒜末放菜里，加食盐。","img":"images/631789/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放鸡精和生抽及白醋。","img":"images/631789/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/631789/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631789/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}